  * for info.
  *
- * Each message block exposes an ARIA live region role so assistive technology
- * user agents announce it appropriately: "alert" for errors and warnings
- * (assertive) and "status" for other message types (polite). This matches the
- * role assignment used by Drupal.theme.message() for messages added by
- * JavaScript. The "contentinfo" landmark role is reserved for the page footer
